WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:08.822
Open Design, Content Definition, Content Types, edit the type that will host the

00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:11.044
wizard, and click Add Parts.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:14.051
Next to Wizard, click Add and Configure.

00:00:14.502 --> 00:00:18.908
Contained content types are the kinds of step this wizard can have.

00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:24.038
Choose Content types and tick them, or choose Stereotype to allow every content

00:00:24.038 --> 00:00:26.572
type that has a stereotype you type.

00:00:27.024 --> 00:00:32.307
Display type is how the steps are shown when the wizard item itself is displayed.

00:00:32.307 --> 00:00:36.861
Collapse contained steps shows them collapsed when you edit a wizard.

00:00:36.861 --> 00:00:40.868
Requires an authenticated user makes visitors sign in first.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:46.029
Completion policy decides what happens to the answers when the wizard finishes:

00:00:46.029 --> 00:00:51.312
create and publish the content items, create them as drafts, or do not keep them.

00:00:51.312 --> 00:00:52.344
Click Save.

